{"id":"wb-4-248","name":"渡江战役总前委旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"渡江战役总前委旧址","text":"渡江战役总前委旧址位于安徽省肥东县撮镇镇瑶岗社区，南临淮南铁路和合马公路，北靠312国道，是渡江战役期间中国人民解放军渡江战役总前敌委员会所在地，1996年，渡江战役总前委旧址被中华人民共和国国务院列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%A1%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%98%E5%BD%B9%E6%80%BB%E5%89%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94113613,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94113613","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/87fb1540d31644eb98f41212.jpg","title":"渡江战役总前委旧址_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B8%A1%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%98%E5%BD%B9%E6%80%BB%E5%89%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/%E6%B8%A1%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%98%E5%BD%B9%E6%80%BB%E5%89%8D%E5%A7%94%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FradonStar","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​渡江战役总前委旧址，位于安徽省合肥市肥东县撮镇镇，全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":240}}